<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Enroute Chopta, we will take a pit stop at Devprayag in early morning to witness the beautiful confluence of Bhagirathi & Alaknanda rivers ultimately becoming Ganga river. Further we will take a halt around Rudraprayag to grab a satisfying breakfast and continue our journey towards Chopta. After arriving in Chopta Valley, check-in to our campsite/homestay, freshen-up and have some leisure. Go for a forest walk and absorb in the charming Himalayan beauty. In the evening, enjoy warm bonfire and mouth-watering snacks under a million stars. Savour home-style cooked dinner and overnight stay in camps/homestay.)
/E (Enroute Chopta, we will take a pit stop at Devprayag in early morning to witness the beautiful confluence of Bhagirathi & Alaknanda rivers ultimately becoming Ganga river. Further we will take a halt around Rudraprayag to grab a satisfying breakfast and continue our journey towards Chopta. After arriving in Chopta Valley, check-in to our campsite/homestay, freshen-up and have some leisure. Go for a forest walk and absorb in the charming Himalayan beauty. In the evening, enjoy warm bonfire and mouth-watering snacks under a million stars. Savour home-style cooked dinner and overnight stay in camps/homestay.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
